{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#card-zh","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 是面向 DSH 的浏览器自动化插件，提供 Web 与 Desktop 会话中的浏览器工具和配置面板。它通过本机 Broker 与 Chrome 扩展连接现有 Chromium 浏览器，让 DSH 读取页面内容、查找控件并执行点击、输入、滚动和导航。还支持截图、批量动作、文件选择与下载，以及结束任务时释放控制。适合希望让 DSH 在已登录浏览器中完成网页资料整理或表单操作的用户；需要本机安装浏览器组件并连接 Chrome。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:36","packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:287","packages/provider-chromium/src/provider.ts:120"]}
{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#card-en","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Native Browser connects DSH to an existing Chromium browser via a local Broker and Chrome extension. Its tools read pages, operate controls, capture screenshots, batch actions, and transfer files. A setup panel connects Chrome. It supports web tasks in an existing browser session.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:36","packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:287","packages/provider-chromium/src/provider.ts:120"]}
