{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#feature-read","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 的功能「读取网页」：读取已控制标签页的可访问页面内容和控件信息，也能按窗口继续读取较长页面。通过 observe 或 read_page 工具触发，结果返回给 DSH 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:353"]}
{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#feature-act","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 的功能「网页交互」：对页面执行点击、填写、追加文本、按键、滚动和导航等动作。调用 act 工具并提供近期观察到的目标，返回动作结果与页面状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:417"]}
{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#feature-visual","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 的功能「截图与视觉点击」：捕获当前授权标签页视口并作为图像附件提供；可结合截图坐标发起视觉点击，执行前会重新核对页面目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:463"]}
{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#feature-batch","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 的功能「批量浏览器操作」：按顺序执行一组有界页面动作，并在步骤失败或结果未确认时停止后续步骤。通过 batch 工具提交动作列表并取得逐步结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:434"]}
{"unit_id":"longmiaoo__dsh-native-browser#feature-tabs","repo":"longmiaoo/dsh-native-browser","commit":"a27b811d070567341f6998fa8076936e651afadb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Native Browser 的功能「连接与标签页控制」：列出浏览器实例和标签页、打开或激活标签页、申请控制并在任务结束时交还控制。由对应的 native_browser 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-adapter/src/index.ts:287"]}
